<Slide padding={0} style={{ background: '#F4F9F6', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
  {/* A 标题块 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, right: 0, height: 110, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 44, background: '#0F5C46', borderRadius: 3, marginRight: 18 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1C2B24' }}>执行摘要 · 合作根基与核心突破</Text>
  </Box>

  {/* B 内容区 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 124, left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 64, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5C6B63', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
      双方基于多年共建学院的深厚互信，由"口头合作意向"升级为<Text style={{ color: '#0F5C46', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>全新股权战略合作</Text>；本次落地最大突破，是校方<Text style={{ color: '#0F5C46', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>首次明确划拨专属实训与办公场地</Text>。
    </Text>

    {/* 2×2 图文卡 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>
      {[
        ['01', '深厚合作根基', '健康管理学院由双方董事长联合创办，互信牢固；叁竹长期仅工商挂靠、无专属场地，健康照护师鉴定资质由叁竹全程协助落地。', 'assets/hero_gate.png'],
        ['02', '核心突破：专属场地划拨', '合作落地后校方划定专属实训教学区 + 独立办公区，合作期永久免费，彻底解决无固定场地痛点，满足省级鉴定站验收硬标准。', 'assets/training_room.png'],
        ['03', '湖外转型刚需', 'AI 压缩传统外语就业空间，亟需依托养老照护国家政策赛道升级专业；UBIC 养老社区缺课程、缺运营、缺人才，本次补齐产业闭环短板。', 'assets/hero_building.png'],
        ['04', '叁竹核心行业实力', '省内养老照护培训稳居前三；九大工种完整自研体系；全国线上招生平台已落地；2025 全年培训突破 6000 人次，品牌壁垒突出。', 'assets/students_training.png'],
      ].map((c, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, overflow: 'hidden', boxShadow: '0 4px 16px rgba(15,92,70,0.08)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Box style={{ height: 128, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
            <Image src={c[3]} style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ padding: '14px 18px 16px 18px', flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
              <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 10, background: 'rgba(46,158,120,0.14)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ color: '#2E9E78', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: "'DIN Alternate','Inter',sans-serif" }}>{c[0]}</Text>
              </Box>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F5C46' }}>{c[1]}</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3A463F', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>{c[2]}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>

  {/* C 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, right: 0, height: 58, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5C6B63', textAlign: 'center' }}>叁竹 × 湖外 校企合作商业计划书</Text>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5C6B63' }}>04 / 27</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
